#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A precise, typographically restrained block theme for senior software engineers. Combines a portfolio, a technical blog, and a consulting rate card in one site, built entirely from core blocks. IBM Plex Sans and Plex Mono are self-hosted, the palette reads like ink on paper, and dark mode follows the visitor's system preference. No custom post types, no settings panel, no external requests."
msgstr ""

